## Colors

Neutrals carry the layout; the single accent marks what the person can do next.

- **Primary:** the one accent. Only for the primary action of a screen and for the selected state.
- **Surface / Surface container:** the screen background and grouped areas such as rows and inputs.
- **On surface / On surface variant:** main text and icons; secondary text.
- **Outline:** dividers and input borders.
- **Error:** errors only.

