## Do's and Don'ts

- Do give each screen one primary action, in the primary color; everything else is secondary or plain text.
- Do make every tap target at least 44x44 pt on iOS or 48x48 dp on Android.
- Do keep text contrast at WCAG AA: 4.5:1 for body text, 3:1 for large text.
- Do use real content from the brief: real names, places, numbers and dates.
- Do follow the platform's navigation conventions.
- Don't use gradients, glass or blur effects, or emoji in headings and buttons.
- Don't add colors, font sizes or corner radii that are not defined above.
